BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:thasos-limenas-fires-of-st-john-klidonas-limenas-skala-marion-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270623
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270625
SUMMARY:Fires of St John (Klidonas)\, Limenas & Skala Marion
LOCATION:Limenas\, Thasos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:On the eve of St John (23 June) Limenas park hosts the 'Fires of Ai-Giannis': the Klidonas divination custom\, choir\, jumping the bonfire and halva handed round. Skala Marion on the west coast keeps the same feast on 23-24 June with an icon procession and a village celebration. First real village events of the Thasos summer.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/thasos/#limenas-fires-of-st-john-klidonas-limenas-skala-marion
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/thasos/#limenas-fires-of-st-john-klidonas-limenas-skala-marion
END:VEVENT
